# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: the lens plug-in, from LumenLens-<ver>.zip.
Package: LumenLens
Section: Graphics
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: any
Depends: Lumen (>= 0.0.38)
Description: Lens profiles for Lumen (lensfun)
 Gives Lumen's Lens Correction the profiles of 1,533 lenses, from the
 lensfun project's database: Lumen corrects their distortion, colour
 fringing and vignetting for each photo's focal length and aperture,
 finding the lens from the photo's EXIF. Only data: it goes into Lumen's
 Plugins directory; Lumen finds it the next time it starts.
Build-Map: !Lumen/Plugins/Lens -> Apps/Graphics/!Lumen/Plugins/Lens
Build-Notice: The lens plug-in for Lumen, packaged for PackMan from its
 release zip.
 .
 The lens database is the lensfun project's, by its contributors, under
 the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 licence, which follows.
Build-Copyright: !Lumen/Plugins/Lens/Licence
